refactorSelector(source, file, from, to) -> proposed source, edits, literal lines, error
    Require distinct selectors with the same category and argument count.
    Parse selector locations and reject conflicting method definitions.
    Replace only matching selector spans, from the end of source backwards.
    Preserve all other text and report each definition/send by line.

refactorPreview(request) -> files and errors
    Read requested native class definitions with their digests.
    Build and validate each proposed class without writing.
    Return source, edits, literal references and per-class errors.

handleRefactor(request) -> preview response
    Require a bounded POST JSON request and return the parsed preview.
